  "prototypeNotes": [
    "This index discovers review records but does not approve them.",
    "The current executable review remains catalog identity review.",
    "Creation mechanics review depends on approved catalog identities, and the slice boundary review depends on both.",
    "Implementation, security, migration, packaging, and release reviews are declared now but materialized only when their work begins.",
    "A review approval becomes invalid whenever its evidence or reviewed artifact fingerprints become stale.",
    "Chronicle owns review discovery, dependency validation, evidence integrity, diagnostics, readiness integration, and promotion enforcement.",
    "Assigned review owners remain responsible for the substantive review decisions."
  ]
